  "priorExpiration": "1992-07-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arb 102.01 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 357-D:5, I, the board shall consist of 5 members and 3 alternate members appointed by the governor and council for a term specified by law.\n\nSource. #5349, INTERIM, eff 3-10-92, EXPIRED 7-8-92\n\nNew. #5461, eff 9-3-92; ss by #6184, eff 2-15-96; ss by #6993, eff 5-7-99",
